8,4,4,Alice Cooper,I was in my tent reading until I fell asleep around 10:30PM.,I heard Thomas arguing with someone around 10PM, but couldn't make out who it was. I found his body in the morning when I went for a walk.,false,suspect_alice.png
8,9,9,Bob Johnson,I was fishing at the other side of the lake until around midnight, then went straight to sleep.,Thomas was threatening to report some... creative accounting I did that made us both look good. He suddenly grew a conscience.,true,suspect_bob.png
8,14,14,Charlie Miller,I was drinking with Thomas until around 11PM, then went to sleep in my tent.,We actually had a good talk and cleared the air about my divorce. I'm sad we finally made peace just before he died.,false,suspect_charlie.png